{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n248.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/haochez"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"In His hand He holds the attribute of judgment. All believe that He is God of faith. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/habochen"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He tests and examines hidden secrets. All believe that He tests the inwards. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hagoel"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He redeems from death and delivers from destruction. All believe that He is a strong redeemer. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hadan"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He judges alone those who come into the world. All believe that He is judge of truth. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hehagui"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is thought of as ‘"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/3/14","type":"quotation"}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"3","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hehagui/quotations/quoted_exodus_3_14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"14","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hehagui/quotations/quoted_exodus_3_14/14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"I am that I am"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":"’. All believe that He was"}
{"start":"j:conditional","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"musaf_haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat_segment_5"}}
{"start":"j:all","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:fs","attrs":{"type":"opensiddur:variant"}}
{"start":"t:f","attrs":{"name":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hehagui/vehoveh"}}
{"start":"t:binary","attrs":{"value":"true"}}
{"end":"t:binary"}
{"end":"t:f"}
{"end":"t:fs"}
{"end":"j:all"}
{"end":"j:conditional"}
{"tail":", is"}
{"start":"j:endConditional","attrs":{"target":"#musaf_haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat_segment_5"}}
{"end":"j:endConditional"}
{"tail":" and shall be. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/havaddai"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Sure is His Name and likewise His fame. All believe that He is with none beside Him. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hazokher"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He remembers those who remember Him in kind memory. All believe that He remembers the covenant. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hachotekh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He distributes life to all the living. All believe that He lives and endures. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hatov"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is good and acts well towards evil and good. All believe that He is good towards all. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hayodea"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He knows the impulse of all creatures. All believe that He has formed them in the womb. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hakol"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He has power over all and contains them all. All believe that He has power over all. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/halan"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Almighty, He dwells in mystery, in shadow. All believe that He alone is He. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hamamlikh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He appoints kings and His is the kingdom. All believe that He is King of the world. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hanoheg"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He leads with His mercy every generation. All believe that He retains kindness. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hasovel"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is long suffering and hides His eye from the stubborn. All believe that He grants pardon. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/haelyon"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is supreme and His eye rests on those who fear Him. All believe that He answers soft prayer. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n250.jpg","n":"115"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hapoteach"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He opens the gates for those who knock in repentance. All believe that His hand is open. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hatzofeh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He waits for the evil-doer and delights in his justification. All believe that He is righteous and upright. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/haqetzar"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He shortens anger and holds back wrath. All believe that He is hard to anger. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/harachum"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Compassionate, He lets mercy precede wrath. All believe that He is soft to appease. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hashaveh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is just and treats small and great equally. All believe that He is a righteous judge. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:haochez_beyad_middat_mishpat/hatam"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is perfect and shows perfection with the flawless. All believe that His work is flawless. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
